{% props book %}

<div class="card bg-base-200 shadow-sm mt-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <h1 class="card-title text-3xl">{{ book.title }}</h1>
            <p class="opacity-70">Auteur : {{ book.author }}</p>

            <div class="mt-2">
                <h2 class="font-semibold mb-1">Catégories</h2>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    {% for category in book.categories %}
                        <a href="{{ path('app_category_show', {id: category.id}) }}" class="badge badge-primary badge-outline">{{ category.name }}</a>
                    {% else %}
                        <span class="opacity-50">Aucune catégorie</span>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-2">
                <h2 class="font-semibold mb-1">Loué par</h2>
                {% if book.user %}
                    <a href="{{ path('app_user_show', {id: book.user.id}) }}" class="link link-hover">{{ book.user.firstname ~ ' ' ~ book.user.lastname }}</a>
                {% else %}
                    <span class="badge badge-success">Disponible</span>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            <h2 class="font-semibold mt-4">Description</h2>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Beatae nesciunt id dolore aut distinctio voluptatibus debitis velit esse eum, aliquid animi totam fuga eius neque accusantium voluptatem! Culpa, unde! Facilis.</p>
        </div>
    </div>